#   carries 3001 errors, essentially all [irq_pending], which are the mutation's own signature on a fixture
#   that raises a line the core cannot see. "ABLATE 0" means zero of the NAMED rule, which is the claim the
#   mutation control has to make and does make. (3002 and 3001 are the tally-corrected totals; a grep -c
